			"Message": "docs(mod): update LanguageFeatures table entry to reflect LNGF fix\n\nThe doc-comment table still described the old single catch-all\n$languageFeatures:registerProvider arm. After the LNGF fix the\nmodule matches on register_*_provider method names, one arm per\nprovider type. Update the table to reflect the new dispatch shape.",
